flowchart TD
    P[Low-voltage power] --> MCU[ESP32 DevKit]
    SOIL[Capacitive soil moisture sensor] -->|Analog signal| MCU
    DHT[DHT22 temperature and humidity] -->|Digital signal| MCU
    MCU --> READ[Read and validate sensors]
    READ --> CTRL[Watering control logic]
    CTRL --> CHECK{Moisture below threshold<br/>and cooldown complete?}
    CHECK -->|Yes| DRIVER[Relay or MOSFET driver]
    DRIVER --> PUMP[Low-voltage DC pump]
    PUMP --> PLANT[Plant / soil]
    CHECK -->|No| WAIT[Continue monitoring]
    MCU <-->|Wi-Fi / HTTP| WEB[ESP32 web server]
    WEB --> UI[Browser dashboard]
    UI -->|Manual ON / OFF| WEB
